      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — July Summer Miser.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 7, power rating 12 → a level 7 Wizard player-character sheet (a player may take this seat; the authored CR 7 stands in where the ledger is silent). Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Summer Witch, Founder of the Jul'library, Adept of the Witches Gathering</strong> — House Miser / Vellanet Rise, The Witches Gathering, The Jul'library, Independent Scriptorium</p><p>Status: Active — resident scholar and wandering conjurer at Vellanet Rise; founder of the Jul'library; affiliated with the Witches Gathering; maintaining spatial boundary wards across the Midlands margins</p><p>July Summer Miser is the second of the five Miser children—born alongside Jack and Archie in the triplet threshold of High Summer—and the arcane anchor of the household. While Jack took to the sword and the Silver Flame's rigid muster roll to feed the cottage, and Archie was consumed by unstable third-eyed pyromancy, July mastered the disciplined geometry of the School of Conjuration. She founded the Jul'library—a roaming repository and scriptorium of bound spaces and extraplanar compendiums based out of Vellanet Rise—and maintains close ties with the Witches Gathering, a loose fellowship of Midlands hedge-scholars and planar herbalists. Patient, sharp-eyed, and carrying the household's emotional weight beneath a tall pointed witch's hat, she commands spatial transposition with clinical precision and keeps an owl familiar named Barnaby watching the tree lines.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Conjurer's Quench-Staff</strong> — “While Jack took to the sword and the Silver Flame's rigid muster roll to feed the cottage, and Archie was consumed by unstable third-eyed pyromancy, July mastered the disciplined geometry of the School of Conjuration.”</li><li><strong>Benign Transposition</strong> — “Patient, sharp-eyed, and carrying the household's emotional weight beneath a tall pointed witch's hat, she commands spatial transposition with clinical precision and keeps an owl familiar named Barnaby watching the tree”</li><li><strong>Founder of the Jul'library</strong> — “She founded the Jul'library—a roaming repository and scriptorium of bound spaces and extraplanar compendiums based out of Vellanet Rise—and maintains close ties with the Witches Gathering, a loose fellowship of Midlands”</li><li><strong>Barnaby the Owl Familiar</strong> — “Patient, sharp-eyed, and carrying the household's emotional weight beneath a tall pointed witch's hat, she commands spatial transposition with clinical precision and keeps an owl familiar named Barnaby watching the tree”</li><li><strong>Witches Gathering Fellowship</strong> — “The Summer Witch, Founder of the Jul'library, Adept of the Witches Gathering”</li><li><strong>School of Conjuration Spellcasting</strong> — “While Jack took to the sword and the Silver Flame's rigid muster roll to feed the cottage, and Archie was consumed by unstable third-eyed pyromancy, July mastered the disciplined geometry of the School of Conjuration.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/july_summer_miser</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/july_summer_miser</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
